WEBVTT

00:00:06.947 --> 00:00:08.427
(DOOR SLAMS, ENGINE STARTS)

00:00:11.587 --> 00:00:13.107
(HORNS HONKING)

00:00:13.187 --> 00:00:14.787
How are we gonna get him now?

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:17.387
Pizza, anyone?

00:00:18.907 --> 00:00:20.707
-Go, go, go! (GRUNTS)
-I got it!

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:21.827
Buzz, are you coming?

00:00:21.907 --> 00:00:25.427
No, I have a lot of
catching up to do with my dad.

00:00:27.147 --> 00:00:31.147
Good throw, son.
That's my boy. Go long, Buzzy!

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:34.227
-Oh, you're a great dad. Yippee!
-Farewell.

00:00:35.027 --> 00:00:36.827
Does anyone know how to drive?

00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:39.347
Slink, take the pedals.
Rex, you navigate.

00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:42.187
Hamm and Potato,
operate the levers and knobs.

00:00:42.907 --> 00:00:44.187
Whoa.

00:00:44.787 --> 00:00:46.747
Ohh.

00:00:46.827 --> 00:00:48.867
-Strangers.
-From the outside.

00:00:48.947 --> 00:00:52.067
-Oh, no.
-He's at a red light! We can catch him!

00:00:52.147 --> 00:00:54.787
-Maximum power, Slink!
-(ENGINE REVS)

00:00:55.827 --> 00:00:58.107
Whaa! It turned green! Hurry!

00:00:58.187 --> 00:01:00.747
-Why won't it go?
-Use the Wand of Power.

00:01:01.347 --> 00:01:02.827
-(GEARS GRINDING)
-(TIRES SQUEALING)

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:07.827
-(SCREAMS)
-Ooh! Ow! Ooh!

00:01:07.907 --> 00:01:11.147
-Rex, which way?
-Left! No, no! I mean right!

00:01:11.227 --> 00:01:14.307
That's right! No, I mean left!
Left is right!

00:01:14.387 --> 00:01:17.307
Buzz, he's turning left!
He's turning left!

00:01:19.507 --> 00:01:21.427
-Oh, oh, boy!
-(GASPS)

00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:23.667
Whoa!

00:01:23.747 --> 00:01:26.307
Oh, I seriously doubt
he's gettin' this kind of mileage.

00:01:26.387 --> 00:01:28.107
Go right! To the right!
Right, right, right, right!

00:01:30.587 --> 00:01:33.227
-Whoa!
-(GASPS, GROANS)

00:01:33.307 --> 00:01:35.907
You have saved our lives.
We are eternally grateful.

00:01:35.987 --> 00:01:37.467
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Whatever.

00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:49.747
WOMAN OVER PA: The white zone is
for immediate loading and unloading...

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:52.907
No parking.

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:57.787
Guys, we can't park here!
It's a white zone!

00:01:57.867 --> 00:02:00.987
You have saved our lives.
We are eternally grateful.

00:02:01.347 --> 00:02:02.867
-Final boarding call...
-There he is!

00:02:02.947 --> 00:02:05.587
...for Far East Airlines
flight 451 to Tokyo.

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.667
All confirmed passengers
with boarding passes

00:02:07.747 --> 00:02:09.507
must board at this time.

00:02:10.387 --> 00:02:11.587
MAN OVER PA: Passenger Twitch,

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.667
passenger Leon Twitch,
please pick up...

00:02:14.787 --> 00:02:17.427
You have saved our lives.
We are eternally grateful.

00:02:17.507 --> 00:02:19.027
POTATO HEAD:
Will you leave me alone?

00:02:19.107 --> 00:02:20.267
REX: Someone's coming!

00:02:20.347 --> 00:02:22.947
-GIRL: Ooh, a puppy!
-Bark, bark, bark, bark.

00:02:23.027 --> 00:02:24.347
Bark, bark, bark, bark, bark.

00:02:25.627 --> 00:02:26.627
Listen, flyboy.

00:02:26.707 --> 00:02:29.547
The contents of that case are
worth more than you make in a year!

00:02:29.627 --> 00:02:31.947
-You got that, sport? You be careful!
-I understand, sir.

00:02:32.027 --> 00:02:34.827
Do you have a "fragile" sticker
or something?

00:02:34.907 --> 00:02:36.947
I had a box of cookies once
that came back as crumbs!

00:02:38.427 --> 00:02:40.507
-The Mystic Portal!
-Oooh.

00:02:40.587 --> 00:02:44.067
Once we go through,
we just need to find that case.

00:02:47.547 --> 00:02:48.547
(GASPS)

00:02:50.947 --> 00:02:53.267
(TOYS SCREAMING)

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:55.907
(ALL GROANING)

00:02:57.347 --> 00:03:02.067
-Ow! There's the case!
-No, there's the case!

00:03:03.187 --> 00:03:04.947
You take that one! We'll take this one!

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:06.987
(ALL GRUNT)

00:03:17.027 --> 00:03:19.387
Whoa! Buzz!

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:22.267
Buzz, my back end's
goin' to Baton Rouge!

00:03:22.867 --> 00:03:25.827
-Slinky!
-(PANTING)

00:03:25.907 --> 00:03:29.107
Here we come, Woody!
Woody, here we come! Woody!

00:03:29.187 --> 00:03:31.307
-(ALL GROAN)
-Nice flash, though.

00:03:33.707 --> 00:03:35.187
(PANTING)

00:03:44.027 --> 00:03:46.707
(PANTING) Okay, Woody, let's go!

00:03:46.787 --> 00:03:50.027
-(GRUNTS, GROANS)
-Take that, space toy.

00:03:50.107 --> 00:03:53.107
Hey! No one does that
to my friend! (GRUNTS)

00:03:55.667 --> 00:03:56.707
(GRUNTS)

00:03:59.787 --> 00:04:01.587
-(YELLS)
-Your choice, Woody.

00:04:01.667 --> 00:04:04.027
You can go to Japan together
or in pieces.

00:04:04.107 --> 00:04:07.827
If he fixed ya once,
he can fix ya again. Now get in the box!

00:04:07.907 --> 00:04:09.987
-Never!
-Fine!

00:04:10.427 --> 00:04:13.587
-(GASPS)
-(YELLS)

00:04:14.427 --> 00:04:15.587
(ALL SHOUT)

00:04:16.347 --> 00:04:18.347
-No! Aaah!
-Gotcha!

00:04:18.427 --> 00:04:20.987
Idiots! Children destroy toys!

00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:23.267
You'll all be ruined, forgotten!

00:04:23.347 --> 00:04:26.347
Spending eternity
rotting in some landfill!

00:04:26.427 --> 00:04:31.587
Well, Stinky Pete, I think it's time you
learned the true meaning of playtime.

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:35.787
-Right over there, guys!
-(WHIMPERING) No. No! No!

00:04:36.747 --> 00:04:40.787
WOMAN OVER PA: Atlantic Air
flight 810 from Point Richmond

00:04:40.867 --> 00:04:42.627
is now arriving at Gate 3.

00:04:42.707 --> 00:04:46.547
GIRL: (GASPING) Look, Barbie.
A big, ugly man doll.

00:04:46.627 --> 00:04:48.547
Ooh, he needs a makeover.

00:04:50.387 --> 00:04:53.507
-(WHIMPERING)
-Hi! You'll like Amy.

00:04:53.627 --> 00:04:56.387
-(GASPS)
-She's an artist!

00:04:56.747 --> 00:04:58.427
(SOBBING)

00:04:58.507 --> 00:05:00.227
MOTHER: Come on, hon!

00:05:02.867 --> 00:05:04.707
Happy trails, Prospector.

00:05:04.827 --> 00:05:06.787
-Buzz! Woody!
-Help us out here!

00:05:07.147 --> 00:05:08.787
-(GASPING)
-Hurry!

00:05:08.867 --> 00:05:12.267
-Oh, no. Jessie! Come on!
-Oh, Woody!

00:05:12.627 --> 00:05:13.747
(JESSIE SCREAMING)

00:05:21.347 --> 00:05:23.467
Jessie! (WHISTLES)

00:05:23.867 --> 00:05:25.467
(GRUNTS) Come on, Buzz.

00:05:25.787 --> 00:05:28.387
-Yah!
-Ride like the wind, Bullseye!

00:05:38.667 --> 00:05:40.587
Hey-howdy-hey! Giddyap!

00:05:41.227 --> 00:05:42.667
BUZZ: Come on, Bullseye! Yah!

00:05:45.467 --> 00:05:47.347
Buzz, give me a boost!

00:05:49.427 --> 00:05:52.467
(GRUNTING, PANTING)

00:05:56.027 --> 00:05:58.387
-Oh! Ohh! Oohhh!
-Woody!

00:06:00.507 --> 00:06:02.027
(GRUNTING)

00:06:10.707 --> 00:06:11.907
(GRUNTS)

